---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Refund Policy"
  description="Plenivostudio refund policy: all sales of downloadable digital products are final, with listed exceptions for duplicate charges and defective files."
  path="/refund-policy"
>
  <section class="section-tight legal">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width: 780px;">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Refund Policy</h1>

      <p class="muted">Last updated: October 2026.</p>

      <h2>All sales are final</h2>
      <p>
        Our products are instantly downloadable digital files. Once a file is
        delivered, it cannot be "returned" the way a physical item can — there
        is no way to give back access to something already copied to your
        device. For that reason, <strong>all sales are final and we do not offer
        refunds for change of mind</strong>, duplicate purchases made in error
        excepted (see below).
      </p>
      <p>
        We provide a <strong>free demo</strong> of the planner so you can
        evaluate it fully before buying. Please try the demo first — it exists
        precisely so you never need a refund.
      </p>

      <h2>Exceptions</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Duplicate charges:</strong> if you were charged twice for the
          same order, contact us and we will refund the duplicate.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Defective files:</strong> if the downloaded files are corrupt
          or do not work as described and we cannot fix or re-deliver them
          within a reasonable time, we will refund the purchase.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How to request an exception refund</h2>
      <p>
        Email info.cosmicragsltd@gmail.com with your order details and a
        description of the problem. Approved refunds are issued
        to the original payment method.
      </p>

      <h2>Please note</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Our payment processor acts as the Merchant of Record for your purchase. Under
          their seller terms they may issue a refund within 60 days of purchase
          to prevent a chargeback, even where our policy above would not grant
          one.
        </li>
        <li>
          For buyers in the EU/UK: by completing a purchase of instantly
          delivered digital content you expressly consent to immediate delivery
          and acknowledge that you lose the 14-day right of withdrawal once
          download begins, as permitted by applicable law.
        </li>
        <li>
          Nothing in this policy limits statutory rights that cannot be waived
          under your local law. Where the law requires a different outcome, the
          law prevails.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Chargebacks</h2>
      <p>
        If something is wrong, please contact us first — most issues (a broken
        download link, a duplicate charge) are resolved within a day. Filing a
        payment dispute without contacting us slows everything down and incurs
        dispute fees.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
